        <h1>Privacy Policy for Zeroperks.com</h1>
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> June 12, 2025</p>

        <p>Zeroperks.com ("Zeroperks", "we", "us", or "our") is committed to protecting the privacy of our users. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and disclose your personal information when you use our website or interact with its features.</p>

        <h2>1. Cookies</h2>
        <p>Zeroperks.com uses cookies and similar technologies to improve your experience. A cookie is a small data file stored on your device.</p>
        <p>We use cookies for:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Essential site functionality (e.g., session tracking, user login)</li>
        <li>Analytics and performance tracking (e.g., Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager)</li>
        <li>Language translation support (e.g., Google Translate)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You may control cookie preferences via your browser. However, disabling cookies may limit some functionality of the website.</p>

        <h2>2. Collection of Information</h2>
        <p>We automatically collect non-personal information such as:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>IP address</li>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Referring/exit pages</li>
        <li>Time and duration of visit</li>
        <li>Device and operating system</li>
        <li>ISP and geolocation (approximate)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If you register or submit content, we may collect:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Email address (if applicable)</li>
        <li>Chosen username (which is public and permanent)</li>
        <li>Any information you submit via forms, comments, or tools on the site</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You should never post anything you don’t want publicly visible. Content posted to Zeroperks may be indexed by search engines (e.g., Google, Bing) and visible to anyone.</p>
        <p>We do not honor requests to delete or modify user-generated content unless compelled by a valid court order. You are responsible for your own submissions.</p>

        <h2>3. Security of Personal Information</h2>
        <p>We implement reasonable technical and organizational safeguards, including encryption via SSL (Secure Socket Layer), to protect personal data. However, no method of internet transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute protection.</p>
        <p>If your account includes a password, you are responsible for maintaining its confidentiality. Avoid saving passwords on shared or public devices.</p>

        <h2>4. Use of Personal Information</h2>
        <p>Your information is used to:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Operate and improve Zeroperks</li>
        <li>Analyze trends and usage</li>
        <li>Manage user-generated content</li>
        <li>Offer tools, resources, and features</li>
        <li>Prevent abuse or illegal activity</li>
        <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We retain data only as long as necessary for its intended purpose or as required by law.</p>

        <h2>5. User Accounts and Deletion</h2>
        <p>Zeroperks.com does not currently offer account-based access or require user registration. If account-based features are introduced in the future, users will be able to:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Access, update, or delete their account information</li>
        <li>Request data removal by contacting us (subject to identity verification and review)</li>
        <li>Request not to receive future communications (unsubscribe options will be provided)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Sharing of Personal Information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties.</p>
        <p>We may disclose your information:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>If required by law, subpoena, or government request</li>
        <li>If necessary to protect our rights, safety, or prevent fraud</li>
        <li>In the event of a business transfer, sale, or reorganization of Zeroperks</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>7. User Responsibility</h2>
        <p>We cannot verify the identity of users posting content. If someone posts material involving you, you must contact them directly. Zeroperks will not share any user data unless legally compelled to do so via subpoena or court order.</p>

        <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our website may include links to third-party sites and services. Their privacy policies may differ from ours, and we do not control or endorse their practices.</p>
        <p>Some pages may embed content or use APIs from platforms like:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Google (e.g., Maps, Translate)</li>
        <li>GitHub</li>
        <li>Social media platforms</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You are encouraged to review the privacy policies of these third parties before using those features.</p>

        <h2>9. Children’s Privacy</h2>
        <p>Zeroperks is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children without parental consent.</p>

        <h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with a revised "Effective Date." Continued use of the website after changes constitutes your acceptance.</p>

        <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, you may contact:</p>
        <address>
        Zeroperks LLC<br>
        <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a><br>
